    <item>
      <title>CRLF at end of line in diff</title>
      <link>/core/git/crlf-at-eol/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/core/git/crlf-at-eol/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;It is nasty to see ^M at end of each line, especially when they are in color.&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;crlf-at-eol.png&#34; alt=&#34;crlf-at-eol&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here is the solution.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;$ git config --global core.whitespace cr-at-eol&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;you don&amp;rsquo;t need &lt;code&gt;-w&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;--ignore-cr-at-eol&lt;/code&gt; if you just don&amp;rsquo;t want let them visible and don&amp;rsquo;t care the difference.&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;crlf-at-eol-2.png&#34; alt=&#34;crlf-at-eol-2&#34;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
